<title>JAPAN: Tottori Bank briefing to concern listing - sources.</title>
<headline>Tottori Bank briefing to concern listing - sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tottori Bank's news conference, scheduled for 3.45 p.m. (0645 GMT) on Friday, is expected to concern the listing of its shares, financial sources said.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the bank declined to say what the news conference would be about.</p>
<p>The unlisted regional bank earlier today denied market rumours that it would merge with Sumitomo Bank Ltd or Sanwa Bank Ltd.</p>
